{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","疾行飞刃"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标造成多次伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","辛巴达的所有技能同时也视为普通攻击，动作速度受到自身攻击速度与急速的共同影响。主动释放时，在3秒内尝试尽可能攻击对手，每次造成100% + 15% ATK伤害。结束后再次攻击目标造成240% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":73,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":63,"end":77,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":91,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次造成的伤害提升至105% + 15% ATK,最后一击造成的伤害提升至250% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":37,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次造成的伤害提升至110% + 15% ATK,最后一击造成的伤害提升至260% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":37,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次造成的伤害提升至115% + 15% ATK,最后一击造成的伤害提升至270% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":37,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","每次造成的伤害提升至120% + 15% ATK,最后一击造成的伤害提升至280% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":37,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","循因索敌"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","收集战场情报，对造成伤害最高以及承伤伤害最多的敌人进行针对性打击。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始6秒后，辛巴达尝试朝己方阵营后方跳跃，落地后开始收集战场情报，找到截止目前累计造成伤害最高的敌人标记为“侵略者”，累计承受伤害最高的敌人标记为“守护者”，情报持续30秒。随后依次冲刺到目标面前进行特殊攻击，造成4次120% + 10% ATK伤害，并使得“侵略者”降低45%攻击力，使得“守护者”受到的伤害提升25%，持续至情报有效期结束。辛巴达在情报有效期结束或者场上同时不存在“侵略者”和“守护者”时再次收集情报，且在收集情报期间处于霸体状态。对首领类敌人的效果降低至原来的20%。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":115,"end":121,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":111,"end":125,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":223,"end":225,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","使得“侵略者”降低50%攻击力，使得“守护者”受到的伤害提升30%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","使得“侵略者”降低55%攻击力，使得“守护者”受到的伤害提升35%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","使得“侵略者”降低60%攻击力，使得“守护者”受到的伤害提升40%。"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","迅闪一击"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标进行一次二连击。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","辛巴达挥舞他的双头刃，对目标造成两次210% + 20% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次伤害提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次伤害提升至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每次伤害提升至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":17,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":21,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升21点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升27点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升33点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","审时度势"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高情报分析的水平，进一步削弱“侵略者”和“守护者”。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","辛巴达提升自己的情报分析水平，分析“侵略者”造成伤害的主要方式，分析“守护者”对抗伤害的主要方式。若“侵略者”造成的伤害主要来源于其普通攻击，则辛巴达还会降低其60点攻击速度，反之则降低60%的回能效率。若“守护者”主要依靠友军或自身的治疗对抗敌人，则辛巴达会降低其60点受愈，反之则降低30%护甲与魔抗。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","若“侵略者”造成的伤害主要来源于其普通攻击，则辛巴达还会降低其80点攻击速度，反之则降低80%的回能效率。若“守护者”主要依靠友军或自身的治疗对抗敌人，则辛巴达会降低其80点受愈，反之则降低40%护甲与魔抗。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","若上次情报分析时的“侵略者”或“守护者”在下次情报分析时再次被对应标记为“侵略者”或“守护者”，则使“侵略者”的攻击力额外降低20%，使“守护者”受到的伤害额外提升10%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“侵略者”攻击力额外降低30%。“守护者”受到的伤害额外提升15%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","攻击情报分析中的对象时伤害提升。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“迅闪一击”在攻击“侵略者”或者“守护者”时伤害在原来基础上提升140% ATK。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","回旋双刃"]]}